.gitignore final-results scheme

Problem found
The previous rule benchmark/results/** ignored the entire tree before later final-result negations could reliably re-include nested files.

Scheme applied
- Ignore immediate children of benchmark/results with benchmark/results/*.
- Re-include benchmark/results/final/.
- Ignore immediate children under benchmark/results/final/ by default.
- Re-include directories under benchmark/results/final/**/.
- Re-include final CSV, JSON, and MD files.
- Keep .latencies and .bin ignored under benchmark/results/final/.
- Keep global *.csv ignored for root and raw CSV files, with final-result CSVs overridden by the later negation.

