Conclusion
The notebook-readable final artifacts CSV/JSON/MD under benchmark/results/final/ are visible to git. Raw .latencies and .bin files remain ignored. No existing benchmark/results result directory was modified except for temporary probe files under benchmark/results/final/gitignore_probe, which were removed.
